  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_12
    value: "<size=15>- A multiplier of Total Bet is awarded as Bonus Pay. \n- Winning
      a Bonus symbol way win awards a bonus with different Free Games options.\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: '<size=16>Wild substitutes for all symbols.

      Wild appears on reels 2, 3, 4 and 5 only.

'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_13
    value: <size=16>Multiplier Wild appears in Free Games on reel 3 only.
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT_1
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT_2
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{3:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      2 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_1
    value: <style=title><size=27>FREE GAMES
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2
    value: <style=title><size=27>MULTIPLIER WILD
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1
    value: "<size=22>- Bonus symbol way win triggers Free Games where user can select
      one of the following: \n  -  15 Free Games, 243 Ways\n  -  10 Free Games, 1024
      Ways\n  -  5 Free Games, 3125 Ways\n  -  3 Free Games, 7776 Ways\n  - Mystery
      Pick\n- Mystery Pick is a random combination of the number of Free Games and
      the number of ways. Maximum provided is 15 Free Games with 7776 ways. \n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2
    value: <size=22>- In Free Games, Multiplier Wild (x2, x3, or x5) appears on reel
      3.
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>243 WAYS</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Base Bet: 75</color></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3
    value: <style=title><size=27>RETRIGGER
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_4
    value: '<style=title><size=27>GOD OF WEALTH JACKPOT

'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3
    value: '<size=22>- During Free Games, 3 or more Bonus Symbols starting from the
      leftmost reel re-triggers the same number of Free Games as initially awarded.

'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4
    value: "<size=22>- Wild symbols appearing during either Base or Free Games may
      randomly trigger the God of Wealth Jackpot. \n- Pick among 12 jackpot coins
      and until 3 of the same jackpots are selected. \n- Mini, Minor, Mega, or Grand
      jackpot may be awarded.\n"
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Zhao Cai Jin Bao
